<title>USA: VTEL Corp 1996 yr loss includes charge.</title>
<headline>VTEL Corp 1996 yr loss includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>FY ended July 31.</p>
<p>			   PRO FORMA STATEMENT OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>						  1996		  1995</p>
<p> Revenues			     $90,630,000	 $65,833,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		  (7,679,000)	   3,841,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share	  ( 0.57)		  0.35</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			  13,495,000	  10,991,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Company changed its fiscal year to end in July from December.</p>
<p>1996 year includes restructuring charges of $550,000 and a $400,000 inventory related charge.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
